  === intro

  The Tower of Sorrows looms before you, a twisted spire of obsidian and moonstone that seems to drink the very light from the sky. For three years, you've tracked the Tear of Luminous—a gem said to contain the last breath of a dying star, stolen from your family's vault by the enigmatic Archmage Thessalon.

  Tonight, the tower's wards flicker and fade with the new moon. Your informant, a nervous half-elf named Mirrik, assured you that Thessalon performs a ritual in the celestial observatory at midnight, leaving the lower levels vulnerable.

  You stand in the shadow of the gatehouse, feeling the weight of your choices. The tower has seven levels, each more treacherous than the last. Guards patrol the grounds—some human mercenaries, others constructs of animated stone and shadow. Your pack contains the tools of your trade, but success will require more than mere equipment.

  The night wind carries the scent of rain and old magic. Time to decide your approach.

