  === main_gate_social

  You stride confidently toward the main gate, adjusting your scholarly robes (hastily purchased from a pawn shop yesterday). Two guards—grizzled veterans with crossbows—step forward to block your path.

  "Tower's closed," the taller one grunts. "Archmage sees nobody after sundown."

  You clear your throat, projecting an air of indignant authority. "I am Professor Aldric Moonwhisper of the Celestial Collegium. The Archmage personally invited me to observe tonight's alignment of the three moons. Surely you received word?"

  The guards exchange uncertain glances.

  * [Press your advantage with more elaborate lies] { charisma >= 3 }
    ~ suspicion += 1
    -> gate_social_success

  * [Offer a generous bribe] { inventory.gold_purse }
    ~ suspicion -= 1
    ~ gold -= 50
    -> gate_bribed

