  === gate_social_success

  Your words flow with practiced ease, each lie building upon the last until you've constructed an entire fictional correspondence between yourself and Thessalon. You mention obscure astronomical phenomena, reference books that may or may not exist, and even forge a signature in mid-air using a minor illusion cantrip.

  The guards' resistance crumbles like old parchment. "Right, right," the shorter one mutters. "The Archmage did mention something about... moon alignment... scholarly types..." He trails off uncertainly, but steps aside.

  "Third floor is the library," he offers. "You can wait there until the Archmage summons you."

  You bow with exaggerated courtesy and sweep through the gate. Inside, the tower's entrance hall is a marvel of dark architecture—vaulted ceilings disappear into shadow, and strange symbols glow faintly on the walls.

  A spiral staircase winds upward, but you also notice a side corridor leading deeper into the complex.

