  === library_floor

  You ascend the spiral stairs to the third floor, where an ornate door marked with glowing sigils announces the tower's library. The door is unlocked—after all, who would steal knowledge from an Archmage?

  Inside, the library is breathtaking. Shelves stretch from floor to ceiling, packed with tomes both mundane and eldritch. A reading area features comfortable chairs and a crackling fireplace. On a desk, you spot several interesting items: a journal lying open, a map of the tower's layout, and a small crystal that pulses with soft light.

  More importantly, you can hear footsteps on the floor above—the fourth level, where Thessalon's private chambers are located according to your intelligence.

