  === fourth_floor_approach

  The fourth floor is quieter, more private. Rich carpets muffle your footsteps as you navigate a corridor lined with portraits of previous tower residents—some human, some decidedly not. At the end of the hall, a large double door bears Thessalon's personal seal.

  To your right, a smaller door stands ajar, revealing what appears to be a study or workshop. To your left, stairs continue upward to the fifth floor—closer to the observatory.

  Through the walls, you can hear a faint chanting from somewhere high above. The ritual has begun, or is about to.

  ~ fourth_floor_reached = true

