  === observatory_approach

  You've reached the sixth floor—the level directly below the observatory. Here, the air thrums with magical energy. The walls are carved with astronomical charts and prophecies. A single staircase spirals up to the observatory door, which you can see from below.

  The door is massive, wrought from silver and adamantine, covered in protective wards that shimmer in the darkness. You'll need both keys to open it, if Velara's journal spoke true. And you have { silver_key ? "both keys" : "only one key—you still need the silver key" }.

  The chanting from above has grown louder. Thessalon's voice rings out, speaking in a language that predates human civilization. The ritual is well underway.

